BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261030-93@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261030T130500Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T233000
SUMMARY:Senri Oe Trio
LOCATION:Birdland Theater\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Halloween night at Birdland. Expect the unexpected. On the most
 
 magical night of the year\, something extraordinary is about to happen at 
 
New York City's legendary Birdland Theater. The music will cast its own spe
 
ll --- and once it does\, you won't want to break free. Senri Oe Trio takes
 
 the stage for two extraordinary nights --- four sets of music that defy ca
 
tegory\, blur boundaries\, and just might bewitch you. Senri Oe is one of t
 
he most remarkable reinventions in contemporary music. Beginning classical 
 
piano at age three and discovering jazz at fifteen\, he first rose to extra
 
ordinary heights in Japan: a multi-platinum recording artist\, Japanese Gra
 
mmy winner\, actor\, television anchor\, and author --- a cultural icon who
 
se name defined an era. At forty-seven\, at the peak of his fame\, Senri ma
 
de a bold and deeply personal choice. He walked away from stardom\, moved t
 
o New York City with his beloved dachshund\, Peace\, and enrolled in The Ne
 
w School for Jazz and Contemporary Music. Under the mentorship of masters i
 
ncluding Junior Mance and Aaron Goldberg\, he reinvented himself from scrat
 
ch. It was not a retreat. It was a return to his first love. Since his 2012
 
 jazz debut\, Boys Mature Slow\, Senri has built a powerful international p
 
resence --- performing at the Atlanta and Detroit Jazz Festivals\, headlini
 
ng SummerFest for two consecutive years\, and charting at #24 on JazzWeek i
 
n 2023 with his album Class of '88. These Birdland performances celebrate t
 
he worldwide release of his latest album\, HOMEWORK (Global release: Septem
 
ber 4\, 2026) --- conceived in his Brooklyn living room and recorded at The
 
 Bunker Studio with bassist Matt Clohesy and drummer Ross Pederson\, with m
 
ixing by Aaron Nevezie. HOMEWORK fuses digital and acoustic worlds into a s
 
oundtrack without visuals: brilliant\, edgy\, and profoundly human. Don't m
 
iss your chance to be part of something unforgettable. This Halloween\, let
 
 the music haunt you. Senri Oe --- piano & all compositions Matt Clohesy --
 
- bass Ross Pederson --- drums Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/ev
 
ent/senri-oe-trio-birdland-theater-tickets/14979683
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/senri-oe-trio-birdland-theater-tickets/
 
14979683
END:VEVENT
